---
---

<section id="sobre" class="py-20 bg-areia">
  <div class="max-w-6xl mx-auto px-6">
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-12 items-center">
      <!-- Texto -->
      <div>
        <h2 class="text-3xl md:text-5xl font-bold text-grafite mb-6 font-space-grotesk">
          Sobre a <span class="text-ambar">Empresa</span>
        </h2>
        <p class="text-chumbo text-lg leading-relaxed mb-6">
          A DYGO Sistemas Digitais foi fundada em 2025, mas carrega consigo um vasto conhecimento técnico acumulado ao longo de anos de experiência em diversas áreas da tecnologia.
        </p>
        <p class="text-chumbo text-lg leading-relaxed mb-6">
          Nosso time domina desenvolvimento de <strong class="text-grafite">ERPs</strong>, <strong class="text-grafite">LMS</strong>, <strong class="text-grafite">CRMs</strong>, landing pages, sell pages e integrações entre sistemas. Trabalhamos com uma ampla rede de desenvolvedores e profissionais de TI, garantindo soluções completas e conectadas.
        </p>
        <p class="text-chumbo text-lg leading-relaxed">
          Embora sejamos uma empresa jovem, nossa expertise já entrega resultados concretos para empresas que buscam transformação digital com foco em confiança e performance.
        </p>
      </div>

      <!-- Cards de expertise -->
      <div class="grid grid-cols-2 gap-4">
        <div class="bg-white p-5 rounded-xl shadow-md border border-chumbo/10 hover:shadow-lg transition-shadow">
          <div class="w-10 h-10 bg-ambar/10 rounded-lg flex items-center justify-center mb-3">
            <svg class="w-5 h-5 text-ambar" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M9 17v-2m3 2v-4m3 4v-6m2 10H7a2 2 0 01-2-2V5a2 2 0 012-2h5.586a1 1 0 01.707.293l5.414 5.414a1 1 0 01.293.707V19a2 2 0 01-2 2z"></path></svg>
          </div>
          <h3 class="font-bold text-grafite font-space-grotesk text-sm">ERP</h3>
          <p class="text-chumbo/80 text-xs mt-1">Sistemas integrados de gestão</p>
        </div>

        <div class="bg-white p-5 rounded-xl shadow-md border border-chumbo/10 hover:shadow-lg transition-shadow">
          <div class="w-10 h-10 bg-ambar/10 rounded-lg flex items-center justify-center mb-3">
            <svg class="w-5 h-5 text-ambar" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M12 6.253v13m0-13C10.832 5.477 9.246 5 7.5 5S4.168 5.477 3 6.253v13C4.168 18.477 5.754 18 7.5 18s3.332.477 4.5 1.253m0-13C13.168 5.477 14.754 5 16.5 5c1.747 0 3.332.477 4.5 1.253v13C19.832 18.477 18.247 18 16.5 18c-1.746 0-3.332.477-4.5 1.253"></path></svg>
          </div>
          <h3 class="font-bold text-grafite font-space-grotesk text-sm">LMS</h3>
          <p class="text-chumbo/80 text-xs mt-1">Plataformas de ensino</p>
        </div>

        <div class="bg-white p-5 rounded-xl shadow-md border border-chumbo/10 hover:shadow-lg transition-shadow">
          <div class="w-10 h-10 bg-ambar/10 rounded-lg flex items-center justify-center mb-3">
            <svg class="w-5 h-5 text-ambar" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M17 20h5v-2a3 3 0 00-5.356-1.857M17 20H7m10 0v-2c0-.656-.126-1.283-.356-1.857M7 20H2v-2a3 3 0 015.356-1.857M7 20v-2c0-.656.126-1.283.356-1.857m0 0a5.002 5.002 0 019.288 0M15 7a3 3 0 11-6 0 3 3 0 016 0z"></path></svg>
          </div>
          <h3 class="font-bold text-grafite font-space-grotesk text-sm">CRM</h3>
          <p class="text-chumbo/80 text-xs mt-1">Gestão de relacionamento</p>
        </div>

        <div class="bg-white p-5 rounded-xl shadow-md border border-chumbo/10 hover:shadow-lg transition-shadow">
          <div class="w-10 h-10 bg-ambar/10 rounded-lg flex items-center justify-center mb-3">
            <svg class="w-5 h-5 text-ambar" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M13 10V3L4 14h7v7l9-11h-7z"></path></svg>
          </div>
          <h3 class="font-bold text-grafite font-space-grotesk text-sm">Integrações</h3>
          <p class="text-chumbo/80 text-xs mt-1">Conexão entre sistemas</p>
        </div>

        <div class="bg-white p-5 rounded-xl shadow-md border border-chumbo/10 hover:shadow-lg transition-shadow">
          <div class="w-10 h-10 bg-ambar/10 rounded-lg flex items-center justify-center mb-3">
            <svg class="w-5 h-5 text-ambar" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M9.75 17L9 20l-1 1h8l-1-1-.75-3M3 13h18M5 17h14a2 2 0 002-2V5a2 2 0 00-2-2H5a2 2 0 00-2 2v10a2 2 0 002 2z"></path></svg>
          </div>
          <h3 class="font-bold text-grafite font-space-grotesk text-sm">Landing Pages</h3>
          <p class="text-chumbo/80 text-xs mt-1">Páginas de conversão</p>
        </div>

        <div class="bg-white p-5 rounded-xl shadow-md border border-chumbo/10 hover:shadow-lg transition-shadow">
          <div class="w-10 h-10 bg-ambar/10 rounded-lg flex items-center justify-center mb-3">
            <svg class="w-5 h-5 text-ambar" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M21 12a9 9 0 01-9 9m9-9a9 9 0 00-9-9m9 9H3m9 9a9 9 0 01-9-9m9 9c1.657 0 3-4.03 3-9s-1.343-9-3-9m0 18c-1.657 0-3-4.03-3-9s1.343-9 3-9m-9 9a9 9 0 019-9"></path></svg>
          </div>
          <h3 class="font-bold text-grafite font-space-grotesk text-sm">Networking</h3>
          <p class="text-chumbo/80 text-xs mt-1">Rede de desenvolvedores</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
